            "Dart error",
            "Initialize at declaration or in constructor"
          ],
          "row3": [
            "❌ Accessing nullable value without check",
            "Runtime crash",
            "Use `?`, `??`, or `if != null`"
          ],
          "row4": [
            "❌ Overusing nullable types",
            "Confusing code",
            "Make only necessary values nullable"
